{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51978","headline":"沁园春 · 吕岩","name":"沁园春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琳馆清标，琼台丽质，何年天上飞来。\n扬州暂倚，后土爲深栽。\n独立乾坤一树，春风占，万朵齐开。\n天然巧，蕊珠圆簇，玉瓣轻裁。\n见一花九朵，类玲珑玉斝，错落琼盃。\n得满盛香露，洗荡尘埃。\n是真元孕育，有仙风道骨，岂是凡胎。\n问真宰，难留下土，携尔上蓬莱。\n（《扬州琼花集》）（〖1〗此词调幷非《沁园春》，原书误题。\n赵遂之谓当作《满庭芳》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}